#. module: architects
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:architects.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                        <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Learn more on how to "
"automate your business using <strong>Odoo Studio</strong></span>\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                    <br/>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                        <span style=\"font-size: "
"14px\">ຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບວິທີສ້າງລະບົບອັດຕະໂນມັດໃຫ້ກັບທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານໂດຍໃຊ້ <strong>Odoo "
"Studio</strong></span>\n"
"                    </span>\n"
"                    <br/>"

#. module: architects
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:architects.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                    It's the heart of your architectural work. It's where "
"you'll track the advancement of the various tasks,\n"
"                    generate new invoices (if needed), and assign tasks to "
"employees and contractors alike. Track your\n"
"                    timesheets, margins, purchase orders, and more using the "
"project menu to quickly access relevant information.\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                    ມັນຄືຫົວໃຈຫຼັກຂອງວຽກງານສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳຂອງທ່ານ. "
"ເປັນບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະຕິດຕາມຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງໜ້າວຽກຕ່າງໆ,\n"
"                    ສ້າງໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນໃໝ່ (ຖ້າຕ້ອງການ), ແລະ ມອບໝາຍໜ້າວຽກໃຫ້ແກ່ພະນັກງານ "
"ແລະ ຜູ້ຮັບເໝົາ. ຕິດຕາມ\n"
"                    ຕາຕະລາງບັນທຶກເວລາ, ກຳໄລສ່ວນຕ່າງ, ໃບສັ່ງຊື້, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ "
"ໂດຍການໃຊ້ເມນູໂຄງການເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ.\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            </span>"

#. module: architects
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:architects.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                    Use the documents app to store and share all project "
"documents. Sub-workspaces get created for each project, and link to these "
"sub-workspace can be shared with customers so that they have a direct access "
"to all produced documents.\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                    ນຳໃຊ້ແອັບເອກະສານເພື່ອຈັດເກັບ ແລະ ແບ່ງປັນເອກະສານໂຄງການທັງໝົດ. "
"ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຍ່ອຍຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໂຄງການ, ແລະ "
"ສາມາດແບ່ງປັນລິ້ງໄປຍັງພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຍ່ອຍເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ກັບລູກຄ້າ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເອກະສານທັງໝົດທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ.\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            </span>"

#. module: architects
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:architects.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                <span style=\"font-size: 14px\">A set of architectural "
"services have already been created and can be edited to match the "
"architects'\n"
"                    services.\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                <span style=\"font-size: "
"14px\">ຊຸດບໍລິການສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳໄດ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ ແລະ ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໃຫ້ກົງກັບ\n"
"                    ການບໍລິການຂອງສະຖາປະນິກໄດ້.\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            </span>"

#. module: architects
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:architects.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                The CRM App is designed to let architecture firms easily "
"manage new prospects, called \"Opportunities\" in Odoo. Track expected "
"revenue, manage communications, and never forget to reach out to interested "
"parties. Opportunities get created in the CRM by filling the \"Contact us\" "
"form on the website, or manually by a salesperson.\n"
"            </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n"
"                ແອັບ CRM "
"ຖືກອອກແບບມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິສັດສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳສາມາດຈັດການລູກຄ້າທີ່ມຸ່ງຫວັງໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ, ເຊິ່ງເອີ້ນວ່າ "
"\"ໂອກາດ\" ໃນ Odoo. ຕິດຕາມລາຍຮັບທີ່ຄາດຫວັງ, ຈັດການການສື່ສານ, ແລະ ບໍ່ພາດການຕິດຕໍ່ຫາຜູ້ທີ່ສົນໃຈ. "
"ໂອກາດຕ່າງໆ ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນ CRM ໂດຍການຕື່ມແບບຟອມ \"ຕິດຕໍ່ພວກເຮົາ\" ຢູ່ໜ້າເວັບໄຊ, ຫຼື "
"ສ້າງຂຶ້ນເອງໂດຍພະນັກງານຂາຍ.\n"
"            </span>"

#. module: architects
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:architects.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Use the "
"Project Menu to quickly access</span></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\"><span style=\"font-size: "
"14px\">ໃຊ້ເມນູໂຄງການເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ</span></span>"

#. module: architects
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:architects.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">A reminder to cancel the opportunity is "
"created when the quotation is sent</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: "
"14px\">ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃຫ້ຍົກເລີກໂອກາດຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອມີການສົ່ງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ</span>"

#. module: architects
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:architects.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Create automated actions to never forget to "
"execute your next steps to keep your business growing, for\n"
"                        example:</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: "
"14px\">ສ້າງການດຳເນີນການແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ພາດຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປໃນການຂັບເຄື່ອນທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເຕີບໃຫຍ່, "
"ຕົວ\n"
"                        ຢ່າງ:</span>"

#. module: architects
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:architects.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Once a quotation has been confirmed, a "
"project is automatically generated in the Project app, with associated "
"tasks.\n"
"            </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">ເມື່ອໃບສະເໜີລາຄາໄດ້ຮັບການຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ, "
"ໂຄງການຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນແອັບໂຄງການ, ພ້ອມກັບໜ້າວຽກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ.\n"
"            </span>"

#. module: architects
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:architects.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">When it's time to provide the customer with "
"an estimate, a quote can be created by clicking the \"New Quotation\"\n"
"                button on the opportunity. These can also be pre-filled "
"using the Quotation Template feature. Quotation\n"
"                Templates allow you to quickly choose a preset that contains "
"sections and their products - especially useful\n"
"                when you're working with similar, elaborate templates.\n"
"            </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 14px\">ເມື່ອຮອດເວລາຕ້ອງສະໜອງການປະເມີນລາຄາໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າ, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາໄດ້ໂດຍການກົດປຸ່ມ \"ໃບສະເໜີລາຄາໃໝ່\"\n"
"                ໃນໜ້າໂອກາດ. "
"ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຍັງສາມາດຕື່ມຂໍ້ມູນລ່ວງໜ້າໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດແບບຟອມໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ. ແບບຟອມ\n"
"                ໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເລືອກຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ ເຊິ່ງປະກອບມີໝວດໝູ່ ແລະ "
"ສິນຄ້າຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ - ເຊິ່ງມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍ\n"
"                ເມື່ອທ່ານຕ້ອງເຮັດວຽກກັບແບບຟອມທີ່ມີລາຍລະອຽດຄ້າຍຄືກັນ.\n"
"            </span>"

#. module: architects
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:architects.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">\n"
"                This industry is made for architects that sell all kind of "
"architectural services such as feasibility studies, schematic design, design "
"development, worksite follow-up, energy efficiency assessment.\n"
"            </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">\n"
